        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Threading Primitives"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "==`with lock:`== acquires and **always** releases",
            "`RLock` lets the same thread re-enter",
            "`Semaphore` caps concurrent holders",
            "`Condition` holds its lock while you wait/notify"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
