            "Otherwise __exit__ always runs",
            "Truthy __exit__ return = suppression",
            "Cleanup order is LIFO in every mechanism"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "Cost",
          "text": "`with` adds about two method calls per block. Irrelevant against any I/O. Worth measuring only in a hot inner loop."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Async Mirrors Sync"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Sync",
            "Async"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "__enter__/__exit__",
